	(text "LED reverse-voltage protection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 128.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "027b7827-9f05-43dc-8199-212aaf3f2114")
	)
	(text "If F201 opens and +24V_FUSED falls towards zero, R204 discharges the gate of\nQ201. Q201 turns off, allowing current to flow from +24V_RAW through R201\nand the red LED D202 to GND. D202 illuminates and D204 turns off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 115.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0d09251a-98f6-46a8-b381-e139f8ec9b53")
	)
	(text "D205 is an SMBJ36CA bidirectional TVS diode connected after F201. It diverts\npositive or negative surge current between +24V_FUSED and GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13535633-6777-467f-a193-59f806a16d04")
	)
	(text "Purpose and power path"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.86 40.426 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "457286a9-0f26-49cc-949f-fa0fad9bb188")
	)
	(text "Transient suppression"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 147.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "563f3e21-d38c-4ebf-97b5-7d2b850d3024")
	)
	(text "200_INPUT_FUSE_PROTECTION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 86 96 108 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "97b4a093-114d-4387-86d7-7bb6aec4d394")
	)
	(text "24 V Input Fuse, Status Indicators and Transient Protection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.86 26.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.6 2.6)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9983f878-6665-471e-b6aa-ea813ec46742")
	)
	(text "With correct input polarity and an intact fuse, +24V_FUSED is approximately\nequal to +24V_RAW. Current flows through R202 and the green LED D204 to GND,\nso D204 illuminates.\n\nR203 and R204 form a divider that drives the gate of Q201. Q201 is an N-channel\nBSS138N MOSFET: pin 1 is the gate, pin 2 is the source connected to GND, and\npin 3 is the drain connected to the red LED anode and R201.\n\nThe positive gate voltage turns Q201 on. Its drain-source channel bypasses\nD202 and holds the red LED anode close to GND, keeping D202 off. Current from\n+24V_RAW then flows through R201 and Q201 to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 74.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a2ea48ac-867a-435a-9908-210ec77ba849")
	)
	(text "D201 and D203 are CD0603-B0240R Schottky diodes connected in antiparallel\nwith D202 and D204, respectively. They limit reverse voltage across the LEDs\napproximately to their forward voltage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 133.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a465345c-0158-4502-935f-ed5ed6c609c2")
	)
	(text "Normal operation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 69.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a725dbc8-5ae7-4c74-bdf5-8f4545e24c0c")
	)
	(text "F201 connects +24V_RAW to +24V_FUSED. It is marked 5 A / 125 V and provides\novercurrent protection according to its time-current characteristic. The\n+24V_FUSED net supplies the downstream input circuitry.\n\nD204 indicates voltage after the fuse. D202 indicates loss of the fused supply\nwhile the raw input remains present. D205 suppresses voltage transients between\n+24V_FUSED and GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.86 45.446 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ded4e8a4-a170-4e22-a30d-31ee296ad4df")
	)
	(text "SHEET GUIDE / 200_INPUT_FUSE_PROTECTION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.86 19.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 86 96 108 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ec94ec68-581c-42f8-a301-05ddd5354811")
	)
	(text "Fuse-open indication"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f52b8035-65da-4d83-8f99-a357aaeff52e")
	)
